{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"react-snippets","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"React Snippets","description":"Components, hooks and common patterns for React in JavaScript and TypeScript.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Snippets"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"snippets":[{"language":"JavaScript","path":"snippets/javascript.json"},{"language":"TypeScript","path":"snippets/typescript.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"snippets/javascript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rfc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function ${1:Component}(${2:props}) {\",\n      \"\\treturn (\",\n      \"\\t\\t<div>$0</div>\",\n      \"\\t);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function component\"\n  },\n  \"useState simple\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ust\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const [${1:value}, ${2:setValue}] = useState(${3:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useState hook\"\n  },\n  \"useEffect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ue\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"useEffect(() => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn () => {};\",\n      \"}, [${1}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useEffect hook\"\n  },\n  \"useMemo\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"um\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:value} = useMemo(() => ${2:compute()}, [${3}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useMemo hook\"\n  },\n  \"useCallback\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ucb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:fn} = useCallback((${2:args}) => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}, [${3}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useCallback hook\"\n  },\n  \"useRef\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ur\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:ref} = useRef(${2:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useRef hook\"\n  },\n  \"useReducer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ured\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const [${1:state}, ${2:dispatch}] = useReducer(${3:reducer}, ${4:initialState});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useReducer hook\"\n  },\n  \"Context\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ctx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:Name}Context = createContext(${2:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"createContext\"\n  },\n  \"Custom hook\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"hook\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export function use${1:Name}(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn {};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A custom hook\"\n  },\n  \"Props interface (TS)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rprops\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"interface ${1:Component}Props {\",\n      \"\\t${2:name}: ${3:string};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A props type\"\n  },\n  \"Map list\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rmap\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{${1:items}.map((${2:item}) => (\",\n      \"\\t<li key={${2:item}.id}>$0</li>\",\n      \"))}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Render a list\"\n  },\n  \"Conditional render\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rcond\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{${1:condition} && (\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \")}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Render when true\"\n  },\n  \"Form submit\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form onSubmit={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); $0 }}>\",\n      \"\\t<input value={${1:value}} onChange={(e) => ${2:setValue}(e.target.value)} />\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A controlled form\"\n  }\n}\n"},"snippets/typescript.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Function component\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rfc\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export default function ${1:Component}(${2:props}) {\",\n      \"\\treturn (\",\n      \"\\t\\t<div>$0</div>\",\n      \"\\t);\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A function component\"\n  },\n  \"useState simple\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ust\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const [${1:value}, ${2:setValue}] = useState(${3:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useState hook\"\n  },\n  \"useEffect\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ue\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"useEffect(() => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn () => {};\",\n      \"}, [${1}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useEffect hook\"\n  },\n  \"useMemo\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"um\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:value} = useMemo(() => ${2:compute()}, [${3}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useMemo hook\"\n  },\n  \"useCallback\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ucb\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:fn} = useCallback((${2:args}) => {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}, [${3}]);\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useCallback hook\"\n  },\n  \"useRef\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ur\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:ref} = useRef(${2:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useRef hook\"\n  },\n  \"useReducer\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ured\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const [${1:state}, ${2:dispatch}] = useReducer(${3:reducer}, ${4:initialState});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"useReducer hook\"\n  },\n  \"Context\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"ctx\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"const ${1:Name}Context = createContext(${2:null});\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"createContext\"\n  },\n  \"Custom hook\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"hook\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"export function use${1:Name}(${2:args}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"\\treturn {};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A custom hook\"\n  },\n  \"Props interface (TS)\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rprops\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"interface ${1:Component}Props {\",\n      \"\\t${2:name}: ${3:string};\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A props type\"\n  },\n  \"Map list\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rmap\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{${1:items}.map((${2:item}) => (\",\n      \"\\t<li key={${2:item}.id}>$0</li>\",\n      \"))}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Render a list\"\n  },\n  \"Conditional render\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rcond\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"{${1:condition} && (\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \")}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Render when true\"\n  },\n  \"Form submit\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"rform\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"<form onSubmit={(e) => { e.preventDefault(); $0 }}>\",\n      \"\\t<input value={${1:value}} onChange={(e) => ${2:setValue}(e.target.value)} />\",\n      \"</form>\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A controlled form\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# React Snippets\n\nComponents, hooks and common patterns for React in JavaScript and TypeScript.\n\nType a prefix and press Tab. 26 snippets.\n\n| Language | Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| JavaScript | `rfc` | A function component |\n| JavaScript | `ust` | useState hook |\n| JavaScript | `ue` | useEffect hook |\n| JavaScript | `um` | useMemo hook |\n| JavaScript | `ucb` | useCallback hook |\n| JavaScript | `ur` | useRef hook |\n| JavaScript | `ured` | useReducer hook |\n| JavaScript | `ctx` | createContext |\n| JavaScript | `hook` | A custom hook |\n| JavaScript | `rprops` | A props type |\n| JavaScript | `rmap` | Render a list |\n| JavaScript | `rcond` | Render when true |\n| JavaScript | `rform` | A controlled form |\n| TypeScript | `rfc` | A function component |\n| TypeScript | `ust` | useState hook |\n| TypeScript | `ue` | useEffect hook |\n| TypeScript | `um` | useMemo hook |\n| TypeScript | `ucb` | useCallback hook |\n| TypeScript | `ur` | useRef hook |\n| TypeScript | `ured` | useReducer hook |\n| TypeScript | `ctx` | createContext |\n| TypeScript | `hook` | A custom hook |\n| TypeScript | `rprops` | A props type |\n| TypeScript | `rmap` | Render a list |\n| TypeScript | `rcond` | Render when true |\n| TypeScript | `rform` | A controlled form |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}